\ This check also exercises the exact unsigned sauce-input bridge
\ on coordinates that are completely outside any native CAL day type.
To check an immense wide sauce input:
  Put "1000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000" into an immense day magnitude wide quantity.
  Set the wide calendar example's calculation day from the immense day magnitude wide quantity given -1.
  Set the wide calendar example's requested day from the immense day magnitude wide quantity given 1.
  Answer the wide calendar example.
  Copy the wide calendar example into the sauce input.
  If the sauce input's calculation count is not "1999999999999999999999999999999999999999969888658",
    put "The huge wide sauce calculation count lost precision." into the check report; exit.
  If the sauce input's requested count is not "2000000000000000000000000000000000000000030111343",
    put "The huge wide sauce requested count lost precision." into the check report; exit.
  If the sauce input's distance count is not "2000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000001",
    put "The huge wide sauce distance lost precision." into the check report; exit.
  If the sauce input's sum count is not "4000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000001",
    put "The huge wide sauce sum lost precision." into the check report; exit.
  If the sauce input's direction count is not "3",
    put "The huge wide sauce direction was not forward." into the check report; exit.

